","value":"＊今(9日)晚至明(10)日基隆北海岸、東半部(含蘭嶼、綠島)沿海及恆春半島有長浪發生的機率，臺灣附近各沿海風浪仍大，浪高約2至4公尺，前往海邊活動請注意安全。＊高溫資訊：西南風沉降影響，天氣高溫炎熱，臺東及花蓮地區有焚風發生的機率，明(10)日白天臺東縣為橙色燈號，有連續出現36度高溫的機率，請加強注意。臺北市、新北市、桃園市、花蓮縣為黃色燈號，請注意。＊自7日0時至9日23時出現較大累積雨量如下:臺北市小油坑410.5毫米，臺中市雪山橋392.5毫米，新竹縣樂山林道6k282.0毫米，苗栗縣雪見262.0毫米，桃園市國一S072K214.0毫米，新北市五指山200.0毫米；較大陣風區域如下：彭佳嶼13級，蘭嶼11級，基隆10級。＊此為第13號颱風最後一次報告。"}],"typhoon-info":[{"section":[{"title":"警報報數","value":"20"},{"title":"警報類別","value":"END"},{"title":"颱風編號","value":"13"},{"title":"颱風資訊","analysis":{"time":"2026-08-09T15:00:00+00:00","position":"27.90,119.80","gust":{"value":"33","unit":"m/s"},"pressure":{"value":"985","unit":"hPa"},"scale":[{"value":"輕度颱風","lang":"zh-TW"},{"value":"SEVERE TROPICAL STORM","lang":"en"}],"max_winds":{"value":"25","unit":"m/s"},"radius_of_15mps":{"value":"100","unit":"km"}},"prediction":{"time":"2026-08-10T15:00:00+00:00","position":"29.90,116.60","gust":{"value":"23","unit":"m/s"},"pressure":{"value":"995","unit":"hPa"},"max_winds":{"value":"15","unit":"m/s"},"radius_of_15mps":{"value":"-","unit":"km"}},"typhoon_name":"DOLPHIN","cwa_typhoon_name":"白海豚"}]}]},"web":"https://www.cwa.gov.tw/V8/C/P/Warning/FIFOWS.html","parameter":[{"valueName":"alert_title","value":"解除颱風警報"}],"area":[{"areaDesc":"基隆市","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10017000"}},{"areaDesc":"臺北市","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"63000000"}},{"areaDesc":"新北市","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"65000000"}},{"areaDesc":"宜蘭縣","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10002000"}},{"areaDesc":"桃園市","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"68000000"}},{"areaDesc":"新竹縣","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10004000"}},{"areaDesc":"新竹市","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10018000"}},{"areaDesc":"花蓮縣","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10015000"}},{"areaDesc":"苗栗縣","geocode":{"valueName":"Taiwan_Geocode_112","value":"10005000"}},{"areaDesc":"臺中市","geocode":{